    "body": "In Gecko there is a list.  In the spec, the only type that gets the \"create a text document\" handling during navigation is \"text/plain\", as far as I can tell....\n\nThe current Gecko list is:\n\n```\ntext/plain\ntext/css\ntext/cache-manifest\ntext/javascript\ntext/ecmascript\napplication/javascript\napplication/x-javascript\napplication/ecmascript\napplication/json\n```\n\nI'm not sure what the corresponding list is for other UAs offhand.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
