    "created_at": "2015-09-09T14:43:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-09T14:43:19Z",
    "body": "This url: `data:text/podunk,aaa` renders as text in Chrome, so it looks like there is nothing further up the callstack preventing random `text/*` types from reaching this code.  I'm not sure we want the spec to say that; there are `text/*` types that it would make sense to hand off to helper apps instead of showing as text in the browser...\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
