    "updated_at": "2015-09-10T16:31:38Z",
    "body": "Note that the section @wanderview references in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/124#issuecomment-138927433 is part of the IANA section which per https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=18496 apparently we want to wholesale remove.\n\nSo it sounds like this issue has mostly mutated into something about speccing the navigation processing model for a variety of text mime types? Is that correct? If so could someone with better understanding maybe rename the issue?\n",
