    "created_at": "2015-09-26T11:29:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-26T14:05:40Z",
    "body": "> that function is used by the NavigationController\n\nSo that is where that name originated.\n\nAnyway, my proposal would be that we start with putting the following MIME types through the text path:\n- text/plain\n- text/cache-manifest (until it's removed, at least)\n- text/css\n- text/vtt\n- JavaScript MIME types (as defined by HTML)\n- JSON MIME types (to be defined as application/json, text/json (per this issue), */*+json)\n\nIf that sounds reasonable I'll prepare a PR.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
