    "created_at": "2015-09-26T13:46:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-26T13:46:13Z",
    "body": "The /+json thing would actually be quite difficult for Gecko to implement given our content dispatch architecture.  We can't really do wildcards during dispatch.  That's also the reason https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=155730 is still open.\n\nSo I guess you could spec that, but we would not be implementing it.\n\nThe rest seems ok, though not sure why `text/vtt` is in there.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
