    "created_at": "2015-09-28T13:41:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-28T13:41:55Z",
    "body": "It is at least as human-readable as text/css and JSON. But it's not clear to me end users want to see a subtitle file inline instead of downloading it. On the other hand, it might be nice for authors to be able to view it inline, and disabling that when using text/vtt could make people avoid using text/vtt over text/plain.\n",
